{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Flyer &amp; Invitation Creator 是一款專為個人及商業用戶設計的海報與邀請函製作 App，提供豐富預設背景、圖層編輯及匯入功能。目前該應用正進行<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>活動，原價為 US $0.99，讓用戶能以零成本建立獨特視覺內容。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-45.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能設計與靈活匯入</h2>\n<p>此 App 支援從相機、照片庫或地圖匯入素材，並提供大量免版稅設計模板、Logo 及字體。用戶可自由調整透明度、顏色與圖層，將完成作品匯出為 PDF 或 PNG 格式，適用於派對、俱樂部活動或商務展示等多元場景，滿足個人至商業用途需求。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-3-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-4-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-5-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Flyer &amp; Invitation Creator</li><li>應用類別：Business</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/flyer-invitation-creator/id799182514?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:21:35.807332+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:06:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:30.372745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:18:47.898979+00:00","content_hash":"9b64d22558c0aede72dd4d5f49c96adabe3082742f11dd977ca1ee055dfd6d8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:21:35.807332+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}